{%- comment -%}
  Twisted X brand fonts for the gift card store: Bebas Neue (headings/accent)
  + Montserrat (body/subheading). Overrides Horizon's font CSS variables so the
  whole store — including the product page — uses the brand type. Rendered late
  in <head> so it wins over the theme's own font-variable definitions.
{%- endcomment -%}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root, body {
    --font-heading--family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    --font-accent--family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    --font-subheading--family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
    --font-body--family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
    --font-paragraph--family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
  }
</style>
